@host = https://localhost:7075
# 替换为数据库中已有账号和密码；不要提交真实凭据或 Token。
@account = ZX001
@password = <password>
@accessToken = <copy-accessToken-from-login-response>
# 从最新 Set-Cookie 中取值；每次刷新后都替换，旧值不能重用。
@refreshToken = <copy-zx_identity_refresh-cookie-value>

### 登录；JSON 返回 JWT Access，随机 Refresh 在 Set-Cookie 中；启动前配置 AuthenticationJwt:SigningKey
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: zh-CN
X-Identity-CSRF: 1

{
  "account": "{{account}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "replaceExistingSession": false
}

### 已返回 AlreadyOnline 且用户确认后接管；重新验密并撤销旧会话
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Identity-CSRF: 1

{
  "account": "{{account}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "replaceExistingSession": true
}

### 当前用户
GET {{host}}/api/Auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept-Language: en-US

### 刷新；Access 可已过期，成功后替换上面的两个 Token 变量
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/refresh
Cookie: zx_identity_refresh={{refreshToken}}
X-Identity-CSRF: 1

### 管理员接口
GET {{host}}/api/Users/getUserList?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 管理员强制下线；替换目标用户 ID，已离线也成功，账号仍可重新登录
POST {{host}}/api/Users/forceLogout?id=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 本人修改密码；成功后重新登录
PUT {{host}}/api/Auth/changePassword
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Identity-CSRF: 1

{
  "currentPassword": "{{password}}",
  "newPassword": "<new-password>"
}

### 退出；使用当前 Cookie 或有效 Bearer，重复调用成功
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Cookie: zx_identity_refresh={{refreshToken}}
X-Identity-CSRF: 1
